        IF `the notice contains what paragraph (7) requires` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "must comply with paragraph (7)" (Marginal readings, (c): a requirement not done is read as the text's no)

